{number: 11}
{title: All Creatures of Our God and King}
{key: C}

{start_of_verse: 1}
[C] All creatures of our [Am] God and King
[F] Lift up your voice and [G] with us sing:
[C] Alleluia! [F] Alle-[C] luia!
Thou [C] burning sun with [Am] golden beam,
Thou [F] silver moon with [G] softer gleam!
O [C] praise Him, O [F] praise Him,
Alle-[C] luia! Alle-[G] luia! Alle-[C] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 2}
Thou [C] rushing wind that [Am] art so strong,
Ye [F] clouds that sail in [G] heav'n along,
O [C] praise Him! Alle-[F] lu-[C] ia!
Thou [C] rising morn in [Am] praise rejoice,
Ye [F] lights of evening, [G] find a voice!
O [C] praise Him, O [F] praise Him,
Alle-[C] luia! Alle-[G] luia! Alle-[C] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 3}
Dear [C] mother earth, who [Am] day by day
Un-[F] foldest blessing [G] on our way,
O [C] praise Him! Alle-[F] lu-[C] ia!
The [C] flow'rs and fruits that [Am] in thee grow,
Let [F] them His glory [G] also show!
O [C] praise Him, O [F] praise Him,
Alle-[C] luia! Alle-[G] luia! Alle-[C] luia!
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: 4}
Let [C] all things their Cre-[Am] ator bless,
And [F] worship Him in [G] humbleness,
O [C] praise Him! Alle-[F] lu-[C] ia!
Praise, [C] praise the Father, [Am] praise the Son
And [F] praise the Spirit, [G] three in one!
O [C] praise Him, O [F] praise Him,
Alle-[C] luia! Alle-[G] luia! Alle-[C] luia!
{end_of_verse}
